---
description: Callables throw HttpsError, stamp audit, never silent return
globs: functions/src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Functions

- Always throw `HttpsError` with a human-readable message.
- Stamp `created_*` / `last_updated_*` on every live write.
- Live update and log row commit in the same transaction.
- Tenant id is the signed-in uid.
